// Switches the email catcher on. The bundle ships in every distribution and registers nothing until
// this configuration exists, so this file — included only by the test and demo aggregates — is the
// whole of the difference between an instance that sends mail and one that files it.
//
// Empty on purpose: the catcher has nothing to configure, and its presence is the setting. Adding
// this to a deployment's own feature is how somebody would catch mail on an instance of their own.
{
    "configurations":{
        "io.uhndata.iap.emailcatcher.internal.CaughtMailService":{
        }
    }
}
